OL,3,AHundreds of flights cancelled across
OL,4,AEast Asia as Typhoon Champi roars
OL,5,Atoward Taiwan
OL,6,
OL,7,FTaiwan is bracing for powerful Typhoon
OL,8,FChampi, which is set to make landfall
OL,9,Fon Friday with gusts of up to 173 kph
OL,10,F(107mph) and a 320km radius that will
OL,11,Fenvelope the entire island
OL,13,FTaiwanese authorities have urged people
OL,14,Fto stay away from coasts and mountains,
OL,15,Fand are evacuating residents on the
OL,16,Fnorth-east coast living near a
OL,17,Flandslide dam at risk of breaching in
OL,18,Fthe storm
OL,20,FHundreds of flights in Taiwan and
OL,21,Fneighbouring Japan have been cancelled,
OL,22,Faffecting thousands of passengers
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
